in attack spells.  The MMoM doesn't double it.  So you'll only get 
it on each of the monsters in the nine squares centered on the target 
square.  Repeated 1-8 times after the initial strike.  Double damage 
on opposite resistant monsters.  Up to ten squares distant.

  "Think you got enough dynamite there, Butch?"


